crates/malaysia-compositor/src/effects/shadow.frag follows the method of Evan
Wallace's "Fast Rounded Rectangle Shadows"
(https://madebyevan.com/shaders/fast-rounded-rectangle-shadows/): the error
function approximation, the blurred row with its curved half width and the
Gaussian samples along y. The article's code is CC0
(http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
